    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000qr6h](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000qr6h) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Aug 26 2025 36km NW of Derbent. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 42.365 longitude 48.198. It impacted 320097 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
